{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1264,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56543d0233a7916e3bd2d369",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見ていろ",
      "source_fingerprint": "d740909be4e51dfb4d6fa907c5aeb35ebb635a545c6650b5f6240cd4c197af7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd8684befceb66b141fc16f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以我目前的实力来看，\r\n该做的事情应该很清楚了。\r\n你可不要做出错误的判断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b09672e65fe72074a750d4e044feb2a829f156d2f9adad6b1b02b764fbb1241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f85414f2678244003d97689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做就要尽全力去做。\r\n千万不要有偷懒的行为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62803e006b52d37b524beaca88f0a0441614667a46ec2d161a7970edafaab87e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb60a66bf04cbf8af32ab03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了，开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1d1a802d1d255df9ce1feff39a9e37c2dc4d01ebacde2f679294886d9f057a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e81af7000a358f0d9ba5e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的行程已经安排好了吗？\r\n……不要慌张，好好想想吧。\r\n我还是有时间可以等你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db75461b88c57acba3488b44c0f87f9e93f638c324b3198f367750ef0857c4b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f54d0622564d486ec0b56b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烦恼训练安排的问题时就找我商量。\r\n自己一个人想出来的办法，\r\n有时候不一定是最好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f91e5b92e6559b6e21aea689a9b8d54141d7bf804f4fb30cdb9103c3dccc3454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76210300e2c18b8ee32d73c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你编排的训练项目配上我的努力，\r\n确实让我有所成长。\r\n……不用担心，我不会让努力白费的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfa7a6607f729e6eda53e05024ef89db74c95ea06ddbd56de102b05b5e5201b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ac7bb847fe378ba717344a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就听听你的意见吧，\r\n看看能否达到我的期望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d76e1fed7d9654976d575b710ff6a607370873b40302db131f016457e8eb6c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1faeb816a4158830b1e9f1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一切都是为了达到强悍而优美……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "423eb44048a771e018ca5a305228481d109ac0ccccc37e173bdfc288d2ec905f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d4b7e1a657bcddcf0b184d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练也是要注重仪态的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a25f63713c50f8ac364182c0274bc512197db995cf8d4305f9fa49dc899693c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126b684b12f55e0a4a57e5c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耀眼的未来，\r\n只存在于日积月累的努力前方……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb184500099e8ad5409ac17e962d1c2dcb8467f769a401afa8b8bd135e5d31c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0da2049d81c6fbe8cd26abc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论如何，努力的身影都很美丽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7ade58cdbcd80ee47954dc227ba20e44bae422a83d5af35eda4f64018608d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c3be7833e79636520ab6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能够驾驭决胜服，\r\n必须要随时提升自己才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37aa10b934a8cc99baf39c75008f3bae8ef8aa155b5235601f24cf09815cf58f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c78cb1c38c423cb299d19103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经接近自己理想的样子了……\r\n但只是接近是不够的。\r\n必须确实成为理想的自己才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0047fa05a2ecf5107ad71c2dd8788b2eee9e60ca9d9b8754da189b6c45865e83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59bc70fadb0d2dcab5bac381",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以理直气壮地告诉任何人，\r\n这就是属于我的决胜服。\r\n这点，我自己也感到很自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc66b4697e4b9c7e44645b84f78688acf5a67e1a22fbc45eaf9a18b2e0533c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bcfc40125121148df3462c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，你竟然没有辜负我的信赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6043cba3d7ca8e53d09b3ffea25ff549ac72ec8f0e871f587746a1a84d1cfef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bac95675b4f65b0c385ba43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以你而言算是做得很不错，值得赞许。",
      "source_fingerprint": "901a2adc91ac68100cfbcd4c447b1eab711a2fb4e87f0f891b5d5711c1956cc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b95a5632d0cd171c71121a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个成绩……\r\n也把你介绍给我母亲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0af3063f6b1110a440744ce22d517d63dfef8c33e99970c5ca72f9f3493cde2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c77fb7bc2236522c4e88bdb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们成功走出了我们自己的路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d03213cbd74feed8fafdb39daf57f4e12ec82b39df739e0a7f04a78d237092bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be04e1c36719d02e40592464",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，又接近了理想一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bad2cb2f3c5f8c81c4c2e727c74ade0a01ab8b6066df658249c3bc33a9218a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1891b58e03024a910d70d78f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是没有极限的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db573820faf096325e71255925426db71de39026dd2e655fdd78e9ecbf04132",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f09da142c41fe0e7d73fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是气槽……有什么事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1969fec19f4cbaea47eeddc426a534a1865e61cde4fe2a754e1acfe40934766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9faa0f5e89a0bc96b39867d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来助你一臂之力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "045b4edbf3a57ef4e241a2151bcf1b6e622d76bf5722789c347a890db62f61ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b1c37d55c3ee493669dede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是个让人操心的家伙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61abd59a6c8e8a3c2f890881ad3109aa470df27d9aa39bd0f0ff375d5c5b9619",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb9c61db884725015435fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要再更努力地段练自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a244b4181b448d6672b4df4d0f5318b96d720ebe28147be83debdd49b74f1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25eb40a9c80d40e5de5cd6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是新的旅程呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "366289127bae6799930be02506f1cb8c23b24a41d0cff1cc1600d939d54c3680",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d95135169cba929850df6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献上光荣的胜利！永恒的美丽！\r\n在此发誓吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b86764ed912a523d2fc1bf76208c6eef0aedf8104d167e9e88b8c8f60f26f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff25632e2a61a326eeaf00d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是气槽。\r\n你做好和我共进退的觉悟了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c835162d4bf2f67a7f36d57c45078c9f090fb89dbee87b4caf68a26f31bf533b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:647ef285524e044b0779b1fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来帮你介绍！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e63c9689ff5cf3c51ebd8dfa3bc96d20714524aea0abca993bb27c24c65b42ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db804f3bd552f1f32909792e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到会说出全能少女这种称赞！\r\n你还真是超乎想象的变……\r\n天才呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c42de0f583f7abb29a74c896c639b03855b40cf51380c92611b69550fa81708",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c592bae2e1ddd98cf917fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b0ea50770e74cc57d8f86c94661e324efb2d5121688e3ebb0854357aea8420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f9d45c21e5c76e70b36c48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bcbb632aa7b2655e8ae26d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后也请继续\r\n当我的搭档【战友】，\r\n一起在最前线奔驰吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "491c93ddca71f1baef4e4f71d6841ff0c70b24e4a5012e0df97fe87121d833d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bda8991a1b7a54b4631821b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再办一次圣地巡礼吧！下次就去\r\n训练员想去的地方！……你到底\r\n有什么样的兴趣嗜好呢？唔呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3b25ab805d62360524669c11ccf3508a72244dd17156a95a9b447c97ad25c6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9603e9c95ccfbcb94a403259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员。新年快……\r\n咦，会不会累？不会不会，从年底\r\n开始活动不断，我充满了活力喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d122a4c3d390dad8ae6abeed95ac61bdce15a28edb03fd39e8f93e91ec0a7f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab39ae827ec66b82c24791d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到处都充满巧克力波动……！\r\n这样实在是太尊了，快要疯了──\r\n呼啊啊啊啊啊～～！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09b1ab3fef73649e6a62374f4e55f01f9c857c4faa3d78786698a4845c836459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a62f25a8269ee895bb03d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我今天会完全\r\n变成一堵墙喔……！快点趁现在\r\n用巧克力帮我补充营养吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57f7bcd25bde1d6108745cb10b699512628fbb452eecb34c03398261bbfd47d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1635498c7e09ac1eafae49c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年只会有一次在某场比赛\r\n碰面的两人。渐渐开始\r\n在意起对方……啊，灵感涌现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1442b864413cd1b32e392b777868259b308586586ee6a2641440edbf87b47d45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81f840475134e99a87c5747c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有着英挺耳朵的她，\r\n以及有着轻巧可爱尾巴的她！\r\n没错，就算变装也能认出是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27ccb50cd38c768f577da2d6e6ae7f427dac3930b44d9aecff4a803a649c7147",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf0bfad871469aaa5423e20e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「反正今年也是一个人」\r\n这样自暴自弃的宣言，\r\n其实是想表达想一起过的心情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48979bcaff848efeb350fbd4877ab4c997166229e50adcdf306d6aa7e5b84ad9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31e1b47e60a0e4b604346bd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要出门一下？\r\n如果能一边欣赏赛马娘，\r\n一边享受圣诞节真是一举两得！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7d527f3503a0df780acce2b961ba0c9cc4e145363ebe015a45a933874abd0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf9f9d8b0fb5f641a529602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感激不尽～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca12d8d7a97ea5b3c318a2466f5b0026ff5c360e441b933ea4bcdfe31737226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fb88ac02aeb25fbe92837d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结束了！交稿跟活动的准备，\r\n以及自己比赛的准备都是……！！\r\n……啊──年底真是太忙了～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e885221224a2f06b44b491c81fbc98abfdd2f7692f79bfc20903310dd707460",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113ddc09472ebbab5a1f75d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n来，一起庆祝吧！\r\n我有看我的推的生日活动预习过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f274e48855088780eacb03b4bcef4989c135dac051dd63a729a3665771edc02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fffe82a2a93a0ae0b94ae642",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得送礼还是先问过\r\n本人想要什么比较好……\r\n……首先，你喜欢什么情境？",
      "source_fingerprint": "999b2352e4e0f49e524750562c174b887608d58b38d7ec26937d152bcaefe885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:750936fe8af0a8ce5ca6e015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇！？我的推传信息来！？\r\n……啊，对了！因为我在粉丝俱乐部\r\n登录过自己的生日……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2aff7ae83b974be78a9489c39ad373f629c0c18941f1c9e65dbb117255c9be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d8c2505420b41e3678dbba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦，因为能收到礼物！？\r\n那我借你我推荐的书，\r\n可以请你告诉我感想……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c48f0e2d3d0ac910006eed6b3f39d156cae2dfb4e95027f7c7594af06521a044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae986f436dcc7a34ca1cc674",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到新公告了。\r\n难道是重新开放贩卖赛马娘周边！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7baac6c2f738c9c780fa57f47896a12935d56ebd63a73d00b03b9df7ddd411d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2fa236f56716d6a2f7fe2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了！会不会是\r\n我预约的赛马娘周边！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d6e94670a9c39c130cd973e97ed89259ef233c7ea2bc6e6fdaac876e0972fe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b7d641964eac6c3949a7af1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎达成任务了！\r\n不愧是喜欢赛马娘的\r\n训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "948f3d6e4c2deced5e247c61755ab37f09fb231a4e456cfbcaeaeb7edf9737b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651fea34561198b944f63daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就快要到了！？\r\n扇子还有手灯……\r\n要准备的东西太多了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1fe9453b945339072ceedaf86f5514ebcb6c30ed102b435eaa364945e4048c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569686c6f8881b462e004ade",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎正在举办中！\r\n快点！背起加油用的商品\r\n冲了啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21d27c984059e27ecaef06e9a26f9a3af01ade3dea6d3c951229cc55ff733eb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d134ef0ddc173b6ca836bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没办法了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4476c0b403933fd36a9dcf9cae622eed5a3ab7cbf24569b2f2ee614f46939001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8125ee231bb5a70fe475ce1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级提升！？\r\n太棒了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1220b2c1e0674890051ff58006a1d3cfe0ed32b3b83cee15111498c09b3293cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86784051a236d3ff6cd3599f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去感受我的推时我会注意\r\n服仪外表不可让我推蒙羞……但挑选\r\n日常服装时就想以「萌」为基准呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5516d8ed59c817ef487fb0caf9898d47a2fc673be5c36f363531f60e722add5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef6e688a675e20ae7b61752",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想知道……那天在计算机店里看到的\r\n神宫的笑容究竟有什么含意──\r\n只好开始学着自组计算机了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31b4be830fe0636862bb05dc9e929f92d2b7c4b9e6131b7a4016bdf366df676d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909d9d9d5f860a783dc14634",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我要跟家人一起去露营喔～\r\n……唔，数码碳我偶尔也是会\r\n不带苦恼地轻松出游的啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf516783d5d7f3759f5832fed63fa88960c75e4039f9acb82d1109ffd11a2880",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569b11d6689a036c234f6472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ffd6052d2c50abbbae87c1e660cce9285d4a401df814de27467edb27ca3c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a76b377837dfea683ffb0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人兴奋难耐呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72bb6d1574307fcde3ed884ac70c99a3dd29b6748e65772c431889ea87a9647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8576442f59fe77ad46ae77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没办法了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4476c0b403933fd36a9dcf9cae622eed5a3ab7cbf24569b2f2ee614f46939001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335607b5978a2b419b02d0fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ffd6052d2c50abbbae87c1e660cce9285d4a401df814de27467edb27ca3c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:566f55952a8365f0ac03e9a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新了高分纪录！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a8a8f4caca140d49b871e628b74d9c04ab5c735bfc46272e91ebf56311397d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a1f8d49813516d6f2ae28b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请多多指教……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df32da16abbc60d78eb1f8d5b391d663ff9d2459d2d8be6b44369ab0f0903b21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e64e0896e607ad949b5ca80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘天堂……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a319a96103eddf126ebd11a2be2c95a29ae0e662a4080e9dcaa77e841bfa3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b93347c9cf9865c2086c650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，真耀眼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7c36efb4aed64837a4e1396578180fb9b5af6af415d6f217bcbfadd33f9877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb875b45abd49dceb32037e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毫无遗漏……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42febbc25b996b47e5a1653afeaee2baabf5b4f51ba05a7699eff5f8c931e5a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6190b6e358617dceefa01b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的可以吗……？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "271c46be32daee6ec4f6936d92c6294ec186efea5d5c3e5889536c747d9943d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "1092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9dc1143bf60f1c3271989b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0babbe30bbbe8e196b3e40f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练是吧！\r\n完全听你安排喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a528932de68c3b8d5bd8ec66189d3e867dfa21157ade16b8736bdd3d3b5e6d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cfb0e26681676d10075cf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呵呵……！\r\n这就是赛马娘的历史……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9374e6cc88d4b2197f04c29c2d7a3f43b3f46e197847d5857365dc4c53e57408",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:338029ca357ce12c315fc654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名参赛吗？\r\n…… 你还真喜欢这种的呢 ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd0a5b01dc7d52954ffb95c4879b887a5c35d57d1ccb377bc34ed6d84d57f1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86248ea0965e4a4924dd1d13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4c249742b609deffd78c19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔喔～～！！\r\n我的推的点点滴滴～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ecacd25b5ed2b4cbf2d36ea15d6a5e8b02bfeb4638d85066245370906917c80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30fc7d656e1f533947b3262b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的登录奖励是这个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daa48be3ffdd831edaa46d9ad0d0ae674e2a77b315d62b5b969caf2d7713ddfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9fe7063fdd47ae69e292ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锁定赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb898188ea75739f805a26ffc13fa5cffb5028f3721b5b59d4e6fd92a64e28e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:714895afb6d120545e015834",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过来吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bed95a7e0a89a7ac8b9d06fb3ebe2a3f27e72cf2fff51da040d9a036e3f288ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55463f140f7d8852b55bb8a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e8a32acad401856a46106ba766023ed46d43197f918a01ca16c19f6d54c0264",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fa073cf741dfacb2322d93a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是太幸福了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88391cf3344987d68cb8a41f1d70064433743361237bcc8660c030b29e364e81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5683b0c5bae70b7dbd221931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想守护这个笑容……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb3490e39aebd016851e4e6d9fca657a778c20a5415bb1f54c585b5440257362",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380b82281359f3bb2c385022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来，好好加油吧！",
